# Clerk Billing for B2C SaaS

Billing is in Beta — pin `@clerk/nextjs` and `clerk-js` versions to avoid breaking API changes.

B2C Billing targets **individual users** (not organizations). Plans and Features are managed in the [Clerk Dashboard](https://dashboard.clerk.com/~/billing/plans), not Stripe Billing. Stripe is used only for payment processing.

## This app's Plans and Features

Use these exact slugs — they must match the Clerk Dashboard.

| Type | Slug | Purpose |
|------|------|---------|
| Plan | `free_plan` | Default free tier |
| Plan | `pro` | Paid subscription |
| Feature | `3_deck_limit` | Free tier — cap deck creation at 3 |
| Feature | `unlimited_decks` | Pro tier — no deck limit |
| Feature | `ai_flashcard_generation` | Pro tier — AI-generated flashcards |

Prefer **feature checks** for entitlements (deck limits, AI access). Use **plan checks** when the whole experience differs by tier (e.g. upgrade prompts).

## Setup

1. Enable Billing in [Billing Settings](https://dashboard.clerk.com/~/billing/settings).
2. Ensure `free_plan` and `pro` exist under **Plans for Users**, each with the Features above attached.
3. Use the Clerk development gateway for local/test; connect a separate production Stripe account for prod.

## Pricing page

Use a dedicated page with `<PricingTable />` from `@clerk/nextjs`:

```tsx
import { PricingTable } from "@clerk/nextjs";

export default function PricingPage() {
  return (
    <div className="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
      <PricingTable />
    </div>
  );
}
```

## Gate access with Plans and Features

Prefer server-side `has()` from `auth()` or client-side `<Show>`.

### Server: `has()` (recommended for pages and actions)

```tsx
import { auth } from "@clerk/nextjs/server";

export default async function CreateDeckPage() {
  const { has } = await auth();

  // Pro-only: unlimited decks
  if (!has({ feature: "unlimited_decks" }) && !has({ feature: "3_deck_limit" })) {
    return <p>Subscribe to create decks.</p>;
  }

  // ...
}

export default async function AiGeneratePage() {
  const { has } = await auth();

  if (!has({ feature: "ai_flashcard_generation" })) {
    return <p>Upgrade to Pro for AI flashcard generation.</p>;
  }

  return <h1>Generate flashcards</h1>;
}
```

Enforce the 3-deck cap in server actions by checking `3_deck_limit` and counting the user's decks before insert.

### Client: `<Show>`

```tsx
import { Show } from "@clerk/nextjs";

export default function AiGenerateButton() {
  return (
    <Show
      when={{ feature: "ai_flashcard_generation" }}
      fallback={<p>Upgrade to Pro for AI flashcard generation.</p>}
    >
      <button>Generate with AI</button>
    </Show>
  );
}
```

Use `when={{ plan: "pro" }}` for tier-wide UI (e.g. upgrade banners). Use `when={{ plan: "free_plan" }}` for free-tier messaging.
